<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es"><head><meta charset="utf-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1" /><link rel="icon" href="/static/brand/favicon.ico" sizes="any" /><title>Task by Academy — Plan semanal</title><%- include('partials/theme-init') %><%- include('partials/styles') %>
<style>
.week-board-wrap{overflow-x:auto;padding-bottom:4px}.week-board{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,minmax(190px,1fr));gap:12px;min-width:1040px}.week-day{display:flex;flex-direction:column;min-height:350px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--radius-card);background:var(--paper);overflow:hidden}.week-day-header{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;padding:13px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.week-day-header strong{font-size:12px}.week-day-header span{display:block;margin-top:3px;font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}.week-day-count{margin:0!important;display:inline-flex!important;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-width:21px;height:21px;padding:0 6px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--lav);color:var(--primary)!important;font-size:10px!important;font-weight:800}.week-day-body{display:flex;flex:1;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;max-height:370px;min-height:290px;overflow-y:auto;overscroll-behavior:contain;padding:10px;scrollbar-width:thin}.week-day-empty{margin:auto 0;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;text-align:center}.week-task-card{border-left:3px solid currentColor;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;background:var(--bg);box-shadow:var(--shadow-1);color:var(--primary);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:5px;font-size:11px;line-height:1.35}.week-task-card:hover{box-shadow:var(--shadow-2)}.week-task-card-title{font-weight:760;color:var(--ink)}.week-task-card-meta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:5px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.week-task-card-bottom{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px}.week-task-card.prio-critica{background:var(--redlight);color:var(--red)}.week-task-card.prio-alta{background:var(--orangelight);color:var(--orange)}.week-task-card.prio-media{background:var(--bluelight);color:var(--blue)}.week-task-card.prio-baja{background:var(--greenlight);color:var(--green)}.plan-insights{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin-top:18px}.plan-insights .card{margin:0}.plan-insights h2{font-size:14px;margin:0 0 15px}.plan-capacity-note{margin:0 0 14px;padding:11px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:var(--radius-control);background:var(--lav);color:var(--primary);font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.55}.plan-capacity-person{margin-top:10px}.plan-capacity-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;margin-bottom:5px;font-size:10.5px}.plan-capacity-person .bar{height:7px;margin:0}.plan-rule{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.plan-rule:last-child{border-bottom:0;padding-bottom:0}.plan-rule-icon{display:grid;place-items:center;flex:0 0 auto;width:31px;height:31px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--lav);color:var(--primary)}.plan-rule strong,.plan-rule p{display:block;margin:0}.plan-rule strong{font-size:11px}.plan-rule p{margin-top:3px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.45}@media (max-width:900px){.plan-insights{grid-template-columns:1fr}}@media (max-width:700px){.week-day{min-height:320px}.week-day-body{min-height:260px;max-height:330px}}
</style></head>
<body><div class="app"><%- include('partials/sidebar', { active: 'plan-semanal', user }) %><main class="content">
<%- include('partials/navbar', { active: 'plan-semanal', actions: [{ label: 'Crear tarea', href: '/tareas/nueva', icon: 'plus', showLabel: true }] }) %>
<div class="topbar"><div><h1 class="page-title">Plan semanal</h1><p class="subtitle">Tareas de todo el equipo organizadas por su fecha de planificación. Abrí una tarjeta para ver sus acciones y cambiar su estado.</p></div></div>
<form method="get" action="/planeacion" class="plan-toolbar"><select name="proyecto" class="plan-project-select" onchange="this.form.submit()"><option value="">Todos los proyectos</option><% projects.forEach(function(p) { %><option value="<%= p.id %>" <%= projectFilter === p.id ? 'selected' : '' %>><%= p.code %> — <%= p.name %></option><% }) %></select><input type="hidden" name="semana" value="<%= weekOffset %>" /><div class="week-nav"><span class="week-nav-label">Semana del <%= weekLabel %></span><div class="week-nav-controls"><a href="/planeacion?semana=<%= weekOffset - 1 %>&proyecto=<%= projectFilter || '' %>" class="week-nav-btn" aria-label="Semana anterior"><%- include('partials/icon', { kind: 'chevron-left', size: 15 }) %></a><a href="/planeacion?semana=<%= weekOffset + 1 %>&proyecto=<%= projectFilter || '' %>" class="week-nav-btn" aria-label="Semana siguiente"><%- include('partials/icon', { kind: 'chevron-right', size: 15 }) %></a></div></div></form>
<div class="week-board-wrap"><div class="week-board" aria-label="Tareas de la semana por día"><% days.forEach(function(day) { %><section class="week-day"><div class="week-day-header"><div><strong><%= day.label %></strong><span><%= day.date %></span></div><span class="week-day-count"><%= day.tasks.length %></span></div><div class="week-day-body"><% if (day.tasks.length === 0) { %><p class="week-day-empty">Sin tareas planificadas</p><% } %><% day.tasks.forEach(function(t) { %><a class="week-task-card prio-<%= t.priority %>" href="/tareas/<%= t.id %>"><span class="week-task-card-title"><%= t.title %></span><span class="week-task-card-meta"><span class="color-dot" style="background:<%= t.ownerColor %>"></span><%= t.ownerName %></span><span class="week-task-card-bottom"><span><%= t.estimate %> h</span><span class="badge <%= t.status %>"><%= t.status %></span></span></a><% }) %></div></section><% }) %></div></div>
<section class="plan-insights"><article class="card pad"><h2>Capacidad del equipo (referencia)</h2><p class="plan-capacity-note">Las horas disponibles son una estimación basada en una capacidad semanal configurable. No representan tiempo trabajado.</p><% teamCapacity.forEach(function(person) { %><div class="plan-capacity-person"><div class="plan-capacity-label"><span><%= person.name %></span><span><%= person.openHours %> / <%= person.weeklyCapacityHours %> h de referencia</span></div><div class="bar"><span style="width:<%= person.loadPct %>%"></span></div></div><% }) %></article><article class="card pad"><h2>Reglas para evitar saturación</h2><div class="plan-rule"><span class="plan-rule-icon"><%- include('partials/icon', { kind: 'reorder', size: 16 }) %></span><span><strong>Varias tareas pueden avanzar en paralelo</strong><p>Cuando no tienen dependencias, respetando el límite del proyecto.</p></span></div><div class="plan-rule"><span class="plan-rule-icon"><%- include('partials/icon', { kind: 'shield', size: 16 }) %></span><span><strong>Tareas dependientes esperan aprobación</strong><p>Una tarea no puede iniciarse si la anterior requerida no ha sido aprobada.</p></span></div><div class="plan-rule"><span class="plan-rule-icon"><%- include('partials/icon', { kind: 'clock', size: 16 }) %></span><span><strong>Se distinguen tiempos previstos y confirmados</strong><p>Las horas reales solo se reportan al terminar y se confirman al aprobar.</p></span></div></article></section>
</main></div></body></html>
